  "details": "1. Verify age while logged into the game. \n\nIt appears if you verify your age while you're logged in. Your status will flip between offline and logged-in. This has been observed in the game and external programs such as VRCX. This also seems to affect the world if you're the instance owner. It will effectively make it impossible to join the correct instance. You will join an empty instance with the same ID. \n\nRestarting the client after verification appears to fix the issue.",
